              theirs builds the bit vectors from text for rank/select
              indexing; ph's bottom-up DECODES the block by merging child
              streams up to the root.  Sequential + shared/distributed/
              external-memory parallel, plus a Huffman-shaped variant (S9).
              Construction only; never measures decode (ph's regime).
              % [USED FOR: docs/WAVELET_TREES.md]}
}

